IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0038.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FRD0038C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 RISK-LVL           PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    05 FRAUD-SCORE        PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM RATE-ACTIVITY
    DISPLAY "RISK-LVL=" RISK-LVL
    DISPLAY "FRAUD-SCORE=" FRAUD-SCORE
    STOP RUN.
RATE-ACTIVITY.
    IF TRAN-CNT-DAY > 30 AND TXN-AMOUNT > 5000
        MOVE 'H' TO RISK-LVL
        MOVE 90 TO FRAUD-SCORE
    ELSE
        IF TRAN-CNT-DAY > 12
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 60 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        ELSE
            IF ACCT-AGE-DAYS < 30
                MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
                MOVE 40 TO FRAUD-SCORE
            ELSE
                MOVE 'L' TO RISK-LVL
                MOVE 10 TO FRAUD-SCORE
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
